<para>This is chosen to mix together with <ref refid="namespacellvm_1a9db8c44b250b90e3ab7e4d144e7c9c2e" kindref="member">ModRefInfo</ref> bits. FIXME: This assumes <ref refid="namespacellvm_1a9db8c44b250b90e3ab7e4d144e7c9c2e" kindref="member">ModRefInfo</ref> lattice will remain 4 bits! <ref refid="class_globals_a_a_result_1_1_function_info_1a3fd3dff91e81708c4c2a430e621a7b2f" kindref="member">FunctionInfo.getModRefInfo()</ref> masks out everything except ModRef so this remains correct. </para>
        </detaileddescription>
