    <briefdescription>
<para>The mod/ref information collected for a particular function. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>We collect information about mod/ref behavior of a function here, both in general and as pertains to specific globals. We only have this detailed information when we know <emphasis>something</emphasis> useful about the behavior. If we saturate to fully general mod/ref, we remove the info for the function. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
